Claude + OpenRouter Setup 👇
1⃣Claude
● Open Claude → Turn Developer Mode ON.
● Ask Claude for the required API configuration.
2⃣OpenRouter
● Go to OpenRouter.com.
● Log in only with a GitHub account that is older than 1 year.
● Go to Models → Search “Claude Opus 5” → Create Key → New.
● Copy the API key.
3⃣Claude
● Go back to Claude.
● Paste the API key into the configuration Claude provided.
● Click Apply/Save. Done! ✅
